   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR Humanitarian Appeal for T&#xfc;rkiye, 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Due to its nature as a response to a humanitarian appeal operational results are general and highly aggregated and the MFA contribution is thus reflected in the overall results reporting by the partner. Please refer to the hyperlink below. https://www.unhcr.org/evaluation-office.html</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This allocation contributes to meeting the objectives of the UNHCR appeal, which aim 1) to improve living conditions of people affected by the earthquakes and 2) to assist people, including refugees, with specific needs to find and access necessary services including documentation and social protection</narrative>
